    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-213" contextRef="c-20">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; font-size: 1em; text-align: inherit"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Enterprise CLH LLC (the &amp;quot;Company&amp;quot;) is a Texas limited liability company and a wholly owned subsidiary of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Enterprise Products Operating LLC, a Texas limited liability company (&amp;quot;EPOLLC&amp;quot;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;EPOLLC in turn is wholly owned by Enterprise Products Partners L.P., a Delaware limited partnership, which is a publicly traded partnership.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company leases certain pipeline capacity from Skelly-Belvieu Pipeline Company, L.L.C., an affiliate of the Company, which owns approximately 570 miles of 8-inch natural gas liquids pipeline that originates in Skellytown, Texas and ends near Houston in Mont Belvieu, Texas.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company's revenues are derived from transportation of natural gas liquids under a tariff regulated by the FERC. The tariff specifies the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services. Revenues are recorded upon delivery of products to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;During 2025, the Company rebilled shippers for under-recovery resulting from the vacated January 20, 2022, rehearing order (Docket No. RM20-14-001) in the amount of $202,574.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;(See Commission's order issued on November 20, 2025 (Docket No. RM93-11-003, paragraph 37, footnote 111)).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;These revenues are reported in account 645 &amp;quot;Unusual or Infrequent Items (credit)&amp;quot; on page 114.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to EPOLLC and does not recognize this liability on the company's financial statements. For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report), the Company employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;br style="page-break-before: always; clear: both" /&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-215" contextRef="c-20">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.09pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.09pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.09pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.09pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; text-indent: -18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 9.09pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:Stat